body (full text, not truncated):

### Privileged issue

- [x] I am a LangGraph maintainer, or was asked directly by a LangGraph maintainer to create an issue here.

### Issue Content

bind_tools return Runnable[LanguageModelInput, BaseMessage], not BaseChatModel and this is actually a bug in type annotations.

Please update the type annotations in create_react_agent to allow one to provide a callable for the model that uses bind_tools and returns a Runnable[LanguageModelInput, BaseMessage].

i.e., we want to widen the accepted types


